cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "TEPC Digital Twin: analytical event, electronics and microdosimetry baseline"
abstract: >-
  A pure-MATLAB analytical surrogate model of a spherical tissue-equivalent
  proportional counter (TEPC), chaining source definition, geometry and field,
  an analytical transport adapter, event construction, gas ionization, drift
  and avalanche gain, a full electronics readout chain, microdosimetric
  analysis, uncertainty propagation and a 16-item red-line validation gate.
  RESEARCH/DEMO delivery label: not a Monte Carlo transport code, not a
  reproduction of any physical device, absolute dose is blocked from release.
authors:
  - name: "TEPC Digital Twin authors"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-06"
license: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/zws20070309/tepc-digital-twin"
keywords:
